Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:29.39,CN,,0,0,25,,{\an7\fs60\blur3}注：《社交网络》，讲述马克·扎克伯格创业故事的电影
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.41,CN,,0,1000,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我回来了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.29,0:00:09.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我回来了
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.49,0:00:12.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我回来了…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.33,0:00:38.16,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}那个 是会碎掉 还是浮起来
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.59,0:00:43.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我有时候也会做啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.41,0:00:44.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}做什么
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.51,0:00:48.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}练习超能力
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我是在想能不能用这个开发新品
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.81,0:00:54.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}哦 新品
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.55,0:00:56.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}鸡尾酒杯啊
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.42,0:00:59.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}但也要考虑性价比嘛
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.63,0:01:03.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}像这样吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.66,0:01:05.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}别提那个了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.51,0:01:09.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}人是很难摆脱成功经验的哦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我们要搞创新才行
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.23,0:01:12.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}创… 什么
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.99,0:01:14.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}怎么了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}等等等等 刚才的话再说一遍
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.40,0:01:18.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}创…创新
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.84,0:01:22.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}泷奈要搞创新吗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.88,0:01:24.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}啊 你是不是看了什么电影
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.78,0:01:26.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}呃 是…是吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.30,0:01:27.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}等等
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.89,0:01:29.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}《社交网络》
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.39,0:01:30.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.14,0:01:32.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}太好了 那个很有意思对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.83,0:01:37.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}让我千束·扎克伯格来引领创新吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.53,0:01:41.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}在哪里呢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}记得是在这附近…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.67,0:01:45.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}有了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}找到了 拿去
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.24,0:01:50.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}是初期的甜品草案哦
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.03,0:01:51.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}说不定能给你点灵感
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.68,0:01:53.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}这是你想出来的吗
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.35,0:01:55.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}很厉害吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}从这里开始的呢
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.23,0:02:00.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我真是天才
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.32,0:02:01.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}是店长才对吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.90,0:02:05.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不对 创新就是指点子吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.73,0:02:09.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}想象力比知识更重要
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.47,0:02:11.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}by 爱因斯坦
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}这个看着不错啊
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.45,0:02:13.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}这个
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.42,0:02:16.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我们去拜托店长吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.31,0:02:17.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不不不不
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.92,0:02:20.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我要让你们看看我不只是有点子而已
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.34,0:02:21.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}桃子花了多少钱
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.67,0:02:22.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}闭嘴
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.03,0:02:23.73,CN,,1100,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}给我看收据…
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.01,0:02:24.54,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}我在集中精神
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.73,0:02:25.38,CN,,0,1100,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}这个要用吗
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.85,0:02:28.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}是这个吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.94,0:02:33.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}做好了
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.47,0:02:34.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}怎么样
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.24,0:02:36.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}无聊 给我退下凡人
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.74,0:02:38.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}泷奈 给他们看看
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.05,0:02:43.21,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}这不是因为成本太高被否决的那个吗
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.21,0:02:45.21,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}来 拿着这个
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.53,0:02:46.82,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}喝吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.97,0:02:50.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}怎么样
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.18,0:02:57.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}奇怪吗
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}这东西太脏了吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.69,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}不甘心
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.69,0:03:02.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}我收拾掉了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.30,0:03:05.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}这收据怎么回事
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.84,0:03:07.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}成本太高了啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}拜托了 就推出这个吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.07,0:03:10.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}不行 不行
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.41,0:03:11.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}太好笑了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.91,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}到底哪里好笑啦
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.06,0:03:14.49,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}吵死了
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.49,0:03:16.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}胡桃 你快来看这个
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}你看像什么
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.77,0:03:17.87,CN,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}干嘛啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.73,0:03:19.54,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}是屁股啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}果然是啊
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.52,0:03:24.65,CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}才不是呢 不是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.41,JP,,0,1000,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}ただいま
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:09.90,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}ただいま
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:12.53,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}ただいま…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.33,0:00:38.16,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}それ　割れるの　浮くの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:43.41,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}私もたまにやるからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.41,0:00:44.51,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}何をです
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:48.84,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}超能力の練習
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.81,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}それを使った新メニューを考えてたんですよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.81,0:00:54.15,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}あっ　新メニュー
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.55,0:00:56.42,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}カクテルグラスか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:59.37,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}ただコスパも考えたいですから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:03.66,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}こうだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:05.51,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}そこから離れましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.51,0:01:09.20,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}人は成功体験から離れにくいのよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.23,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}イノベーションを起こしましょうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:12.99,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}イノ…　なんて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:14.02,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}なんです
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.40,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}ちょちょちょ　今のもう一回言って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:18.86,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}イ… イノベーション
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:22.88,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}たきなが　イノベーションですか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:24.78,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}あっ　なんか映画見ただろ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.78,0:01:26.30,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}えっ　ま… まあ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:27.23,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}待って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:29.39,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}『ソーシャルネットワーク』
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.39,0:01:30.14,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}そうですよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:32.83,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}やった　あれおもろいよな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:37.67,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}チサト・ザッカーバーグがイノベーションを起こしたるわ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:41.72,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}どこだったかな
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.67,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}たしかこの辺に…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:45.42,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}あった
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.30,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}あった　ほれ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:50.03,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}初期メニュー案だよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:51.68,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}なんかヒントにならんかね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:53.35,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}千束が考えてたんですか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.35,0:01:55.60,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}すごいだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.23,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}ここからですもんね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:00.32,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}天才じゃわ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:01.90,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}店長がですよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.90,0:02:05.73,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}いや　イノベーションとはアイデアのことでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:09.47,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}想像力は知識よりも重要である
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:11.12,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}バイ　アインシュタイン
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.45,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}これいいじゃないですか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.45,0:02:13.41,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}これ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:16.31,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}店長にお願いしましょうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:17.92,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}いやいやいやいや
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.92,0:02:20.34,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}アイデアだけじゃないところ見せたるわ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:21.67,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}桃いくらでした
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.67,0:02:22.63,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}シャラップ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.03,0:02:23.73,JP,,1100,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}領収書見せてくだ…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:24.54,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}集中してるから
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.73,0:02:25.38,JP,,0,1100,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}これ使うの
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:28.03,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}これだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:33.10,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}できた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:34.24,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}どうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:36.27,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}つまらん　引っ込め凡人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:38.27,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}見せてやれ　たきな
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:43.21,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}これ　原価高すぎてボツったやつじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:45.21,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}はい　これ持って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:46.82,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}飲んで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:50.05,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}どうでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:57.40,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}変ですか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.32,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}こんなん汚いだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:00.69,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}悔しい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:02.43,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}もう　片付けますよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:05.84,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}なんですこの領収書
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:07.41,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}これ原価高すぎですよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.07,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}頼むよ　これ出そうよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:10.41,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}無理です　無理です
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:11.62,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}めっちゃおもしろい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.91,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}なにがそんなにおもしろいんですか
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:14.49,JP,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}うるせぇわ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:16.25,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}くるみ　見て見て　これ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.87,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4039D1&\blur3}ね　なんに見える
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.77,0:03:17.87,JP,,1200,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}なんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:19.54,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6CA2C9&\blur3}けつじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.52,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H969F1C&\blur3}やっぱそうじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:24.65,JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE922A&\blur3}違いますよ　違います
